
MS32TEST - INT 33h from a native program
  00h reset: EAX 0000FFFFh, two buttons ok
  24h version 8.20, and the type ok
  03h after a reset ok
  movement ok
  negative positions and counts are 32-bit negative ok
  pointers are offsets, and the slot ends them ok
  0Ch handler at ring 3 on the way out of INT 21h ok
  and the program resumes with its registers ok
  a second event waits, then comes from a clock tick ok
  0Ch mask chooses the events ok
  14h swaps the handler out ok
  21h/F0h AL=8 wakes for the mouse when asked ok
  1Fh/20h disable and enable ok
MS32TEST done.
